  Update Model Permissions


› 1. Ask for approval    Read and edit workspace files and run commands, with
                         approval required for internet access or edits outside
                         the workspace
  2. Full Access         Use with caution: Elpis can edit files outside this
                         workspace and access the internet without approval
  3. Bypass permissions  Elpis will run anything without asking: any command,
                         any file, the internet, even commands it would
                         otherwise refuse (such as rm -rf). Only your own rules,
                         hooks and managed policy can still stop it.

